  "Agent HQ is included with all GitHub Copilot plans, with no separate marketplace purchase required, and works on github.com, VS Code, and GitHub Mobile.": 1,
  "Agent HQ supports a workflow of assigning the same issue to several agents side by side and comparing their pull requests.": 1,
  "GitHub Agent HQ is a centralized orchestration layer that lets teams deploy, monitor, and compare GitHub Copilot, Anthropic Claude, and OpenAI Codex agents from a single interface.": 1,
  "In Agent HQ, agent selection happens through the Assignees dropdown on any GitHub issue, and the agents' work is standardized under GitHub's existing issue and PR model.": 1,
